# Consuming @juanmandev/hispashare-mcp from GitHub Packages.
#
# Copy to .npmrc (gitignored) — or add these lines to ~/.npmrc to use the
# package from anywhere. GitHub Packages requires authentication even for
# public packages, so a token is not optional.
#
# Token: a classic PAT with the `read:packages` scope
# (https://github.com/settings/tokens). Export it as GITHUB_TOKEN rather than
# pasting it here, so the file stays safe to read over someone's shoulder.
@juanmandev:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
